* Complete LTspice netlist for LTC4281 Hot-Swap Controller

* Input Voltage Source
V1 IN 0 PWL(0 0 1m 12)

* Sense Resistor (5mOhm for 5A current limit)
Rsense IN SENSE_M 0.005

* External N-Channel MOSFET
M1 SENSE_M GATE OUT OUT N_MOS
.model N_MOS VDMOS(Rg=1 Vto=2 Rd=10m Rs=1m Rb=1m Kp=60 Cgdmax=1n Cgdmin=0.5n Cgs=2n Cjo=1n Is=10p mtriode=1.2)

* Gate capacitor to control inrush slew rate
C_gate GATE OUT 10n

* LTC4281 Instantiation
* Pin Mapping:
* 1:SENSE+  (IN)
* 2:SENSE-  (SENSE_M)
* 3:VDD     (SENSE_M)
* 4:SOURCE  (OUT)
* 5:GATE    (GATE)
* 6:OUT     (OUT)
* 7:FB      (FB)
* 8:CFILTER (CFILTER)
* 9:GPIO1   (NC1)
* 10:GPIO2  (NC2)
* 11:GPIO3  (NC3)
* 12:GND    (0)
* 13:INTVCC (INTVCC)
* 14:EE     (0)
* 15:WP     (0)
* 16:SDAI   (VDD33)
* 17:SDAO   (NC4)
* 18:SCL    (VDD33)
* 19:ALERT# (NC5)
* 20:ADIN   (0)
* 21:VDD33  (VDD33)
* 22:ON     (ON)
* 23:OV     (0)
* 24:UV     (ON)
* 25:TIMER  (TIMER)
* 26:FAULT# (NC6)
* 27:PG#    (NC7)
* 28:EN#    (0)
X1 IN SENSE_M SENSE_M OUT GATE OUT FB CFILTER NC1 NC2 NC3 0 INTVCC 0 0 VDD33 NC4 VDD33 NC5 0 VDD33 ON 0 ON TIMER NC6 NC7 0 LTC4281

* Resistor divider for ON and UV pins (Threshold is 1.28V)
R_ON1 IN ON 100k
R_ON2 ON 0 15k

* Resistor divider for FB pin (Threshold is 1.28V)
R_FB1 OUT FB 100k
R_FB2 FB 0 15k

* Capacitors for timing, filtering, and internal LDOs
C_CFILTER CFILTER 0 10n
C_TIMER TIMER 0 100n
C_INTVCC INTVCC 0 1u
C_VDD33 VDD33 0 1u

* Pull-ups and dummy loads for open-drain/NC pins to prevent floating nodes
R_ALERT NC5 VDD33 10k
R_FAULT NC6 VDD33 10k
R_PG NC7 VDD33 10k
R_SDAO NC4 VDD33 10k
R_GPIO1 NC1 0 10k
R_GPIO2 NC2 0 10k
R_GPIO3 NC3 0 10k

* Output Load
R_load OUT 0 12
C_load OUT 0 100u

* Analysis Directive
.tran 100m
.end
